{"ts":"2026-08-10T15:58:27.581Z","type":"quest-declared","sealed":{"doneWhen":{"probe":"test-receipt","args":{"file":"solve/evidence/formation-barrier-release-snapshot-coherence.receipt.json","requiredReceipts":["engaged-barrier-releases-from-one-coherent-snapshot","fail-closed-guards-and-timeout-preserved"]}},"frontierMetrics":[{"probe":"test-receipt","args":{"file":"solve/evidence/formation-barrier-release-snapshot-coherence.receipt.json","requiredReceipts":["engaged-barrier-releases-from-one-coherent-snapshot","fail-closed-guards-and-timeout-preserved"]}}],"authoringContractVersion":1,"statement":"An engaged operation-ledger formation barrier evaluates all of its release legs against one coherent observation snapshot per iteration and releases when the ledger partition is genuinely spread and its own self-operations are terminal: the joiner's awaitOperationLedgerFormationBarrier (src/bootstrap/node-joining-operation-ledger-formation-readiness.js) stops requiring independently-fetched legs (owner-RPC spread proof, concentration, in-flight-op drain) to happen to align across separate reads while an actively-working rebalancer churns — a healthy busy cluster must converge the barrier, not starve it. Verified at HEAD a754867c0 (runs public-path-multinode-baseline-20260810T154716Z/155045Z): with every lower face fixed (0 terminal refusals, 16+ operations completing, 25 CREATE_REPLICA per run), the barrier still oscillated waiting_for_ledger_spread (14) <-> waiting_for_ledger_observation (13) for the full 135s with spreadProofComplete flapping true/false at steady observedVoterCount=3 via owner_rpc_lane and inFlightOperationCount null — the per-leg observations are fetched at different instants and evaluated cross-iteration (the D1 recorded decision left the barrier untouched while its slow legs were being fixed; the legs are now fast and the coherence gap is the binding face). Q1's heavier bootstrap (more partition services, more formation moves) makes leg misalignment more likely, so the epic's gate quest cannot reach its consecutive-pass streak without this. Fail-closed floor: the 120s timeout still throws (never silently degrades an engaged barrier); the engagement latch, BYPASSED_INSUFFICIENT_COHORT, durable-rejoin and snapshot-absent guards, and the sequential-growth/two-node fail-closed cases keep their exact semantics (guard cases at test/convergence/dt-formation-priority-placement-before-active.test.js:680,715,752 stay green).","title":null,"class":"product","constraints":[{"id":"source-change-subagent-verification","statement":"If this Quest changes source code, spawn a subagent verifier before audit and git handoff, then record a Solver finding with evidence subagent:<id>."}],"verificationTemplates":["formation-circularity","sweep-timer"],"frontierIds":["formation-barrier-release-snapshot-coherence-main"]}}
{"ts":"2026-08-10T17:18:20.102Z","type":"attempt","frontier":"formation-barrier-release-snapshot-coherence-main","rung":"observe","rungIndex":1,"prevRungIndex":0,"hypothesis":"Coherent per-iteration barrier release evidence, fixing three diagnosed incoherences in the snapshot builder (loop/resolver/timeout/latch/bypass byte-identical): (1) stale-cache verdict substitution — owner-RPC placement was consulted only when the joiner's never-converging cache looked bad and RPC failure silently substituted the cache verdict, making the spread/observation flap track pure lane availability; (2) terminal-ghost deadlock — the shared predicate counts REMOVING rows as voters so a completed REMOVE's lingering services row read 'concentrated' forever while the drain leg that could prove it terminal was gated BEHIND that verdict and never invoked (inFlightOperationCount:null = never attempted); (3) cache-only release hole — a good-looking cache skipped the RPC leg so an engaged barrier could release with zero authoritative proof. Now: engaged iterations always fetch the owner-RPC leg; raw (ACTIVE+REMOVING) and settled (ACTIVE-only) projections computed from the SAME rows via the frozen shared predicate; unavailable leg = typed defer never a cache verdict; self-scoped drain read in the same pass; SATISFIED = settled 3/3/unconcentrated AND zero in-flight self-ops. Drain scope verdict: strictly self-scoped SELECT_OPERATIONS_BY_ENTITY, not widened. Fail-closed floor byte-preserved (120s throw, guards, latch, run-22 in-flight REMOVE hold); fail-closed TIGHTENING recorded: cache-spread joiners can no longer release unproven. Red-on-revert: 3 new DT cases red on HEAD src (starves past budget; drain never consulted; cache-only release), green with fix; guard matrix 82/82; neighbors 409 assertions; receipts 2/2; unused-exports baseline tightened 1445->1444; verifier zero must-fix/should-fix. Optional live observation did not execute (launch died; orchestrator runs the live batch post-landing).","changeRef":"diff:solve/changes/formation-barrier-release-snapshot-coherence/attempt-1.diff","metricBefore":null,"metricAfter":0,"metricDirection":"lower-is-better","invalidSample":false,"baselineAbsent":true,"done":true,"evidence":"solve/evidence/formation-barrier-release-snapshot-coherence.receipt.json","beforeEvidence":"solve/evidence/formation-barrier-release-snapshot-coherence.receipt.json","beforeEvidenceIdentity":{"path":"solve/evidence/formation-barrier-release-snapshot-coherence.receipt.json","resolvedPath":"/media/peter/4509da27-4751-4dee-b366-f3983d0777252/peter/projects/lagrange/solve/evidence/formation-barrier-release-snapshot-coherence.receipt.json","exists":false,"size":null,"mtimeMs":null,"sha256":null,"probe":"test-receipt","args":{"file":"solve/evidence/formation-barrier-release-snapshot-coherence.receipt.json","requiredReceipts":["engaged-barrier-releases-from-one-coherent-snapshot","fail-closed-guards-and-timeout-preserved"]},"observedAt":"2026-08-10T15:58:27.582Z","fingerprint":"5a9a59975ef5d924169881c67d539780cc6badb8930a15501c2b128e1c0cbf17"},"beforeEvidenceFingerprint":"5a9a59975ef5d924169881c67d539780cc6badb8930a15501c2b128e1c0cbf17","evidenceIdentity":{"path":"solve/evidence/formation-barrier-release-snapshot-coherence.receipt.json","resolvedPath":"/media/peter/4509da27-4751-4dee-b366-f3983d0777252/peter/projects/lagrange/solve/evidence/formation-barrier-release-snapshot-coherence.receipt.json","exists":true,"size":2647,"mtimeMs":1786378818481.9072,"sha256":"8b0b9d231e3895f1071d454b788eec3e2590e51a0d3c2f989582e461e4385ef2","probe":"test-receipt","args":{"file":"solve/evidence/formation-barrier-release-snapshot-coherence.receipt.json","requiredReceipts":["engaged-barrier-releases-from-one-coherent-snapshot","fail-closed-guards-and-timeout-preserved"]},"observedAt":"2026-08-10T17:18:20.091Z","fingerprint":"b216c665f01b0f6f1b939d53aa36e765ddcd660ba7f85b6b0fd773155d2c4017"},"evidenceFingerprint":"b216c665f01b0f6f1b939d53aa36e765ddcd660ba7f